<Who nb="2"/>
Ista:k, ista:k nochi n' iteyo *por racimo** mochi:wa ihkwí:n miak mochi:wa n' *racimo**.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="354.693" endTime="361.824">
